  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10370-PPG_Blue-Green Atolls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the Blue-Green Atolls concept (PIF) into a full UNDP/GEF project: Blue-Green Atolls: Addressing Land Degradation, Groundwater Salinization &amp; Coastal Erosion in RMI via climate-resilient strategies for the Republic of the Marshall Islands (RMI). The project aims to strengthen climate resilience and prevent land degradation by combining climate-smart water management with ecosystem and land restoration using EbA/NbS and organic waste-to-compost approaches</narrative>
  </description>
